[{"code":"output_path_collision","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":13,"col":1},"end":{"line":13,"col":5}},"title":"OUTPUT PATHS COLLIDE","message":"This program prerenders the routes `/a/` and `/a/index`, whose pages are one\nfile on a file system that folds case, as macOS (APFS) and Windows (NTFS) do:\n\n- `a/index.html`, written for `/a/`\n- `a/index.html`, written for `/a/index`\n\nA build's output is the same set of files on every file system, so this is\nrefused and nothing is written (`docs/design/prerender.md` §7.4;\n`docs/design/backend.md` §2). List each page once, under one spelling."}]
